cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these tables, please cite them as below and name the commit or tag you used."
title: "OntoMeter Corpus: a multi-registry snapshot of the ontology ecosystem"
abstract: >-
  Ontologies collected from ten public registries, parsed and deduplicated across
  registries and releases, with three networks between them (namespaces, class
  subsumption, specialisation), first-evidence dates and per-ontology metrics.
type: dataset
authors:
